Error [E1101]: `count` is a mutable value — the new task might outlive this scope
  --> tests/ui/task_capture.jet:3:15
    |
  3 |     t :: task {
    |               ^
 Why: tasks run concurrently; changing an outer binding inside a task would make ownership unclear
 Fix: create task-local state inside the task, or send updates through a channel

Error [E0402]: this call can fail and nothing checks it
  --> tests/ui/task_capture.jet:6:7
    |
  6 |     t.join()
    |       ^^^^
 Why: a fallible result can't be ignored — handle it or say failure is impossible
 Fix: use `?`, `??`, `panic ...`, or `.drop("reason")` to intentionally discard
